**📡 Contact Page** — 6 social/contact cards (LinkedIn, Email, Discord, GitHub, etc.) plus a team grid with avatar initials. Cards open the relevant links.

**🎬 Hackathon Timeline** — A visual alternating timeline with 5 events from the Spring 2024 hackathon. Each event has a date, tag badge, description, and a click-to-play YouTube video embed (just swap the `videoId` values with your real YouTube IDs in the `HACKATHON_EVENTS` array).

**🧠 DSA Quiz Game** — Full auth flow (register/login persisted in localStorage), then:
- Choose from 5 topics: Arrays, Linked Lists, Trees & Graphs, Sorting Algorithms, Big-O Complexity
- 4 questions per topic with Easy/Medium/Hard difficulty labels
- Instant feedback with explanations after each answer
- Score tracking on your profile
- Per-topic leaderboard showing all registered users' best scores

**To customize:**
- Replace YouTube `videoId` values in the `HACKATHON_EVENTS` array with your real video IDs
- Update team names/roles in `ContactPage`
- Update LinkedIn/email/social links in the `contacts` array
- Add more questions to the `QUESTIONS` object following the same schema
